   "t": "Ne faites pas attention à la robe.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Do not pay attention to the dress.' A polite negative imperative with the idiom faire attention a.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "C'est un court-métrage sans argent.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'It is a short film without money.' The compound noun court-metrage meaning a short movie.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
