   "t": "Non, plus maintenant.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'No, not anymore.' An elliptical negative response using plus maintenant.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Ce passage est drôle, regarde.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'This passage is funny, look.' Sofia points out a humorous moment with an imperative.",
