   "t": "On fait ça plus tard?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Shall we do this later?' An informal suggestion with the pronoun on.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "gabriel",
   "t": "Non, continuons, ça va.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'No, let us continue, it is fine.' Gabriel insists on continuing the viewing.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
